OL,3,GNEWSANeighbours next to sports pitch
OL,4,Aclaim floodlights keeping kids awake at
OL,5,Anight
OL,6,
OL,7,FNeighbours living by a school are
OL,8,Fdemanding it removes sports pitch
OL,9,Ffloodlights amid claims they stop
OL,10,Fchildren from sleeping.
OL,12,FResidents said they have complained
OL,13,Fabout them for years, but concerns have
OL,14,Fintensified since a report said they
OL,15,Fwere different from those granted
OL,16,Fapproval.
OL,18,FA report published in 2024 by lighting
OL,19,Fconsultants, The Lighting Bee, was sent
OL,20,Fto resident Tim Pearson after he made a
OL,21,FFreedom of Information Request (FOI) to
OL,22,Fthe council.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
