OL,3,GNEWSANeighbours next to sports pitch
OL,4,Aclaim floodlights keeping kids awake at
OL,5,Anight
OL,6,
OL,7,FPearson said he had fought against the
OL,8,Flights - at Cefn Saeson comprehensive
OL,9,Fschool in Cimla, Neath, which he
OL,10,Fbranded a "total nuisance" - since they
OL,11,Fwere put up, as they had lit up
OL,12,Fneighbouring homes and gardens.
